{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2014/01/15/1241450/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は、ゆったんとお仕事でしたヽ(^ω^)ノヽ(^ω^)ノヽ(^ω^)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しかったなーーー＊＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだ言えないのだけど、\n話せるときがきたら、話します！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっ今日ね、自分で髪巻いたん！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近できるようになったん(o^^o)！←自慢げ（笑）"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2014/01/15/1241450/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どおかなどおかな？(* ^o^ *)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とにかく自分で巻けたというのが嬉しいので、\n報告したいわたし←(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもまだ2回目だから、もうちょっと上手にできるようなりたいっo(^^)o"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今この髪の長さ気に入ってるので、\n色々楽しみたいなあ ♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2014/01/15/1241450/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＊小さな豆知識：実は、おデコにみっつ、ほくろがある(笑) しかも、三角形！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうでもいい┏( .-. ┏ ) ┓┏( .-. ┏ ) ┓┏( .-. ┏ ) ┓┏( .-. ┏ ) ┓┏( .-. ┏ ) ┓┏( .-. ┏ ) ┓┏( .-. ┏ ) ┓┏( .-. ┏ ) ┓┏( .-. ┏ ) ┓ふぎゃーーーーーー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問にこたえるよ(ミ＾o＾ミ)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎　好きなドラマは？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＊　金八先生がすきです！（笑）\n金八先生は正義だわー／(^o^)＼\n兼末健次郎と、鶴本直のがすきです！！！というか、上戸 彩さんがイケメンすぎて　泣ける。(;_;)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他はあんまり知らなくて...ドラマ見ないんですよ(。> <。)\n女優も夢のひとつだけど、演技を見るなら舞台のほうが楽しくて\nあの頃あれが流行ってたよねーとかいうテレビの話にはついていけない。（笑）\n特撮とかアニメだけじゃなく、もっと三次元に興味をだそうかな。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よし！今年はドラマを見てみようと思います！o(^^)o\nどなたか面白いドラマ教えてください！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみぃぃーーーーーーー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2014/01/15/1241450/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2014/01/15/1241450/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆにゃんヽ(。・ω・。)正義！"}],"source":"archive"}